Z||000004||Reality||12-30-2001||10:48 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by banditbalz:<BR><B>I'm getting a copy from Future Shop. We don't get it here until Jan. 2nd though.<P>What are the special features?<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Interactive eight camera angle stunt sequence.<BR>Movie magic interactive special effects.<BR>Racer X:th article that inspired the movie.<BR>The makeing of the Fast and Furious.<BR>Visual effects montage featuring the first race.<BR>Feature commentary with director Rob Cohen.<BR>Exclusive featurette on editting for the Motion Picture Association of America.<BR>Deleted scenes with optional directors commentary.<BR>Music Videos:JaRule "Furious", Caddillac Tah "POV City Anthem", Saliva "Click Click Boom".<BR>Theatrical Trailer.<P>The funny part about that floor board thing is when Vin Diesel Jumps in the car during the police chase sequence the floor board is back! Also another bloober is when the civics are chaseing the last Semi if you watch when the stunt man jumps from the back of the car onto the truck the spoiler on the Civic is missing a level. IE it's a two level one that has the top taken off. But in the next shot showing the Civic the two level wing is back. These are just some of the things I noticed. <P>Also there is a warning at the beginning of the movie stateing that all stunts are performed by trained professionals and that everyone should drive safely. <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Reality (edited 12-30-2001).]||||reg||1
